        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20080509183854/http://nellitheertha.com/docs-shaivam/ska_sk_lagunyasa.pdf">Laghunyasa</a> (PDF, Kannada)</li>
          <li><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20080509185243/http://nellitheertha.com/docs-shaivam/ska_sk_namakam.pdf">Rudra Namakam</a> (PDF, Kannada)</li>
